{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/b88bdb0f3520cdc0253ce257ca8d4b1b.poster.avif?t=1768561148\" width=748 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/b88bdb0f3520cdc0253ce257ca8d4b1b.webm?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/b88bdb0f3520cdc0253ce257ca8d4b1b.mp4?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Residents of Eggon,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We thank you for your continued support through silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Given the exceptional circumstances currently facing Eggon, you have been selected to assist us in carrying out critical community operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eggon Committee hereby extends an official appointment:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/store_bag.gif?t=1768561148\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Position Title:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Management Enforcement Officer of Eggon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Temporary-Permanent Appointment)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/1afb7d228dd12d4dce000035441d7971.poster.avif?t=1768561148\" width=640 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/1afb7d228dd12d4dce000035441d7971.webm?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/1afb7d228dd12d4dce000035441d7971.mp4?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission Duties:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive opaque instructions from higher authorities and carry out daily tasks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain basic order, health, and psychological stability of residents</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate distribution of supplies and enforce spatial restrictions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage public opinion flow and prevent rumor spread</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When necessary, make decisions in the best interest of Eggon as a whole</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/3a10dfbbe28a676445f1076338f63455.poster.avif?t=1768561148\" width=640 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/3a10dfbbe28a676445f1076338f63455.webm?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/3a10dfbbe28a676445f1076338f63455.mp4?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your area of responsibility includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units 01 to 05 \u2014 five core residents, each with a distinct personality and behavior pattern.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/8546c93c459b2041fe827aebfddc56cf.poster.avif?t=1768561148\" width=640 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/8546c93c459b2041fe827aebfddc56cf.webm?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/8546c93c459b2041fe827aebfddc56cf.mp4?t=1768561148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: ~2 hours. Multiple endings await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply focus on your assigned duties \u2014 we have full confidence in your capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Eggon Committee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stardate 7024<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788900/extras/store_flag.gif?t=1768561148\" /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Call from Eggon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788900/cc9c266cd5d3f73183dddd3ecc4097093b832176.jpg"},{"name":"Outstanding Administrator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788900/d024bfedd651c3e7c11df8c871e56fce28c119dc.jpg"},{"name":"Silence in the Shell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788900/9d289a711fce4fa70d3252a403dc7d7be46efa12.jpg"},{"name":"Attention, Official Message","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788900/81ab6b552c2e09b585356920d147684664d2616b.jpg"},{"name":"Who's the Excellent Citizen?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788900/753ff8f7af3970b9bb4492365b64918a29d2b1b9.jpg"},{"name":"Will You Remember Me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea